window.products.push({"id":347018,"name":"Yingluo Lunch Box,Hot Water Heating Portable Food Warmer,Removable 304 Stainless Steel Spoon And Portable Insulation Bag,1.1L,Yellow","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616NFXgVFCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【STURDY AND HEAT-RESISTANT MATERIAL】The lunch box is made of heat resistant and sturdy materials like food grade PP plastic and 304 stainless steel,non-toxic,high-temperature resistant,durable,safe to use,Which Compliant with ROHS and FDA.Guarding your health.Please Note: Do not heat the product with microwave. 【SMALL BODY, LARGE CAPACITY】This elegant heated lunch box is very easy to carry out,It has a capacity of 900ml lunch box + 200ml soup bowl to meet your needs for diverse cuisine, plus the package includes Alloy chopsticks and 304 stainless steel spoons,Thickened durable insulation tote bag, portable and durable insulation 【LEAK-PROOF EASY TO CLEAN 】 The portable Insulation box is designed with silicone sealing ring, Four sides with snaps, sealed against leakage,which perfectly improves the defect of food leakage. The small box comes with a 304 stainless steel removable 【BOILING WATER HEATING, FAST HEATING】The separate inner liner lunch box just inject hot water to warm up the rice can play a heat preservation effect, without plugging in electricity, easy and convenientHeats up quickly but retains the moisture of the food,which makes food taste better. Warm tip: Please add water to keep warm when dining flat, do not carry in the process of loading hot water to prevent overflow burns. 【A HEART-WARMING GIFT】Still worried about always eating cold/fast food or standing in long lines for food during lunch break? A cute and practical lunch box is the perfect gift for yourself or your family/friends to enjoy a delicious warm meal inside the truck, in the office, outdoors, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616NFXgVFCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yingluo","source_asin":"B0BJBL3N4B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-347018","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJBL3N4B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJBL3N4B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":347019,"name":"Thick Alpaca Wool Blanket – Heavyweight Alpaca Wool Blanket for Camping Outdoors or Using Indoors | Soft Peruvian Alpaca Wool Blankets (Blue Jean - So","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":259.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YZaDHjvZL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"COZY COMFORT MEETS ELEGANT DESIGN: From chilly autumn evenings to the dead of winter, staying comfortably warm at night isn’t always easy. Thin blankets made with synthetic materials do little to shield you from the cold, making it impossible to enjoy a restful sleep. Our alpaca wool blanket solves that problem so you don't ever have to worry about uncomfortable sleep again. FEATURES: ✔ King size (110\" x 92\")✔ Queen size (95\" x 92”)✔ Twin size (82\" x 62”)✔ Travel size (72\" x 53”)✔ Full range of stunning color combinations✔ For best results, dry clean only TRY RISK FREE WITH OUR MONEY BACK GUARANTEE: Snuggle up with our alpaca wool blanket for comfort you can’t find anywhere else. Luxuriously thick and heavy, our wool blanket wraps you in a cloak of warmth that effectively blocks out cold. But because it remains breathable, there’s no uncomfortable overheating. Order your wool throw blanket now and wrap yourself in comfort! WHY CHOOSE OUR ALPACA WOOL BLANKET? We offer a full range of stunning color combinations, ensuring there’s a design that suits your taste, lifestyle and décor. Made in Peru and shipped from Florida, we deliver quality right to your front door. Our wool blanket's selected fibers result in a strong, durable fabric you'll love for years to come. GIFT OUR ALPACA WOOL BLANKET TO ANY LOVED ONE! Our wool thick blanket is great for sporting events, camping trips and family picnics. It delivers go-anywhere warmth when you need it most. While similar blankets can be stiff and scratchy, ours is incredibly soft and smooth. Our wool blanket will make the perfect gift to anyone, even you! ADD TO CART NOW!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YZaDHjvZL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Alpaca Warehouse","source_asin":"B08818HCGW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-347019","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08818HCGW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08818HCGW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
