window.products.push({"id":347031,"name":"TUMOVO Large 3 Piece Canvas Wall Art for Living Room- Boat Trip at Strbske Pleso in The Slovak High Tatra Mountains Lake - Modern Home Decor Stretched","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":86.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61I6swg4tuL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"1,Registered Artwork Brand: TUMOVO Since 2015,TUMOVO has been obsessed with one thing: providing customers with the highest quality canvas wall art anywhere.Now 15% off coupon when you purchase 2 or more in （TUMOVO）TuAnn Store 2,Our Product High definition picture printing on water-proof polyester canvas (280GSM) HD Photo Prints on Quality Canvas, long lasting durability coating (Eco-solvent Ink), this Canvas Prints is water-proof, moisture-proof and UV-resistant.Once printed, the canvas is hand-stretched on formaldehyde-free MDF stretcher frames for a lightweight and warp resistant finish. 3,Canvas Description: Boat trip at Strbske Pleso in the Slovak High Tatra Mountains. 4,Beautiful Art For Every Wall Such as Work Place What's worse than a dreadful Monday to Friday 9-5 job? Bare, bland, windowless walls that remind you that you're stuck there inevitably. Many of our customers purchase nature scenes as a faux window to increase their cubicle sanity. 5,Transportation guarantee These prints ship with hanging nails and are securely packaged with EPE and strong boxes to avoid any damage during shipment.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61I6swg4tuL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TUMOVO","source_asin":"B07PYTMHT8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-347031","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PYTMHT8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PYTMHT8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":347032,"name":"Michel Design Works Padded Cotton Oven Mitt, Earl Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51iU6IEkreL._AC_.jpg","description":"Every kitchen can use a new padded oven mitt. The front carries a terrific design, the back is a coordinating solid color and the inside is quilted. Extra length for added protection. Sold individually. Made of 100% cotton. Michel Design Works was created by Bruce & Deborah Michel in the early 1980s. The first product was an elaborate \"memory book\" called Our Country Diary. Still a favorite today, it is filled with vintage artwork, quirky quotes, notable dates and plenty of room to record all the events of the year. Our Country Diary will become a beautiful record of your family life. When they first created their signature elephant logo, it signified a remembrance of all things special. Although Michel Design Works has greatly expanded into bath & body, home fragrance and decor, when Bruce & Deborah remember and celebrate all of their wonderful customers and the company's history, it is even more fitting today! Whether you are a new or a long-time friend, we welcome you to enjoy the art, lather up with our English soaps, set an elegant table with napkins, candles, plates, and serve ware, and end your day with wonderfully fragrant bubble bath.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51iU6IEkreL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Michel Design Works","source_asin":"B07FN1JQYR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-347032","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FN1JQYR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FN1JQYR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
