window.products.push({"id":347040,"name":"ALFALFA Sunshine Forest Tapestry Morning Green Trees Woodland Grasses Natural Landscape Wall Hanging for Living Room Bedroom Dorm, 90\" W x 71\" L (230c","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oxOI6mZNL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The goodness of life is its rich and colorful, to make life interesting, to enrich it continuously. Our artistic tapestry would like to remind you to love yourself, enjoy your life. Except ensure 100% satisfied the products quality, we pay more attention to designs (what kind of pattern, color, measurement), to transform art into physical tapestry, to dress up your room full of joys. We offer Multi Themed Tapestry: Festival holiday: Christmas, Thanksgiving Day, Halloween, Valentine, Easter, Father's day, Mother's day, Children's day etc Multi Styles: beach,ocean sea, underwater world, tropical plant palm coconut tree forest, winter,sunset, animals, african black girls, marble, supre hero, cute cartoon, sports, baby children kids, skulls, flowers, art, fun funny tapestry etc Tapestry can as a gift to your family or friend, it should be interesting. They will be surprised by the colorful artistic design when they open the present. How to Remove Crease: After days of folding in pack, it may has a little crease (normally not), do not worry, it can be settled very easily.  1.Iron softly at low temperature on the back side of tapestry 2.Wash then hanging it flat, it will be flat 3.Doing nothing, just hang it up, crease will be reduced until disappear by a week or two How to Maintain: 1.Hand Wash or Machine Wash (Gentle Cycle), under cold water 2.Do not bleach, not dry clean 3.Dry flat, Hanging to dry, or Low tumble dry 4.Low Temperature iron if needed About Size: There is 1-2cm/0.4”-0.8” difference according to manual measurement, please understand About Color: Please note that slight color difference should be acceptable due to the light and screen","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oxOI6mZNL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ALFALFA","source_asin":"B08263XK87","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-347040","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08263XK87","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08263XK87","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
