window.products.push({"id":347189,"name":"Arslo 20 oz Stainless Steel Skinny Tumbler bulk, Vacuum Insulated Tumbler with Straw and Lid, Double Wall Travel Mugs for Coffee Water Sublimation Tum","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712keNERhaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🥛【5 MINUTES TO BE UNIQUE】:Straight body and exclusive lacquer coat designed for thermal dye sublimation! No matter roller thermocompressor or sublimation oven, both of which are able to perfectly display the pattern. After sublimation, the pattern still holds clearness and fullness! The designed skinny tumbler with lid, makes sure an easy and seamless package, even for big motifs. (Attention! The complimentary silicon base mustn’t be heated with the tumbler.) 🧊【Extra Accessories】:In order to give customers a better already safer experience, I changed the previous stainless steel straw into 4 new plastic flexible straws with straw brushes, 4 pieces of heat-dyed sublimation shrink film and 4 silicone bases to each notch packaging. (Stainless steel straws with straws can better protect drinks from dust and water spills, but not leak-proof.) ⏰【SUBLIMATION NOTES 1】: How to avoid Tumbler sublimation failure? Pay attention to the time and temperature! Temperatures above 400°F or prolonged heating may cause the shrink wrap to burn and stick to the tumbler. The temperature of the oven is too low, the sublimation pattern will not be clear and full. 👉【SUBLIMATION NOTES 2】:Be sure to cover the entire tumbler with sublimation paper! Avoid uneven heating that may cause the shrink wrap to stick to the Tumbler. 🌈【AFTER-SALES CAREFREE】After reading these or failed and damaged the tumbler? Never mind, contact us, we will send you a new one and it is free! (only once)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712keNERhaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Arslo","source_asin":"B09WJHP1L6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-347189","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WJHP1L6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WJHP1L6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
