window.products.push({"id":347375,"name":"YELING Vacuum Insulated Travel Water Bottle | Leak-Proof Double Walled Stainless Steel Cola Shape Portable Water Bottle | No Sweating, Keeps Your Drin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719EBMrJBtL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"YELING Vacuum Insulated Travel Water Bottle | Leak-proof Double Walled Stainless Steel Cola Shape Portable Bottle | Keeps Drink Hot & Cold Sturdy, Durable Quality: This sleek and rugged sports water bottle is made from high quality food grade 18/8 stainless steel that will not break. It is crafted and designed to last and should not rust. Perfect Size: 25 oz, 17 oz or 12 oz capacity is large enough to fit your daily hydration needs. You can also store milk or coffee. The stainless steel repels any lingering flavors. Put your portable sports water bottle in your gym bag, backpack or briefcase as your daily companion. No Leaks: The travel water bottle comes with a leak proof, insulated, BPA and Phthalates free cap. The stainless steel lid will prevent any accidental spills. Easy Flow: The open mouth allows the water to stream out while on the go to help you stay hydrated. The double walled vacuum insulated water bottle allows for easy filling and cleaning. Even when filled with ice, the bottle will not sweat. Daily Lifestyle: Take this easy to carry portable water bottle while hiking, biking, shopping or leave it at the office. While sitting anywhere in any temperature condition, your cold drink will stay perfectly chilled up to 24 hours or your coffee, tea or hot drink will keep hot for up to 12 hours. Cleaning: Hand washing your travel water bottle is recommended with a bottle brush. The bottle is NOT dishwasher safe. The lid is top rack only, but hand washing is also preferred. Please do NOT store sugary drinks in the water bottle for more than 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719EBMrJBtL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YELING","source_asin":"B075XKF8MD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-347375","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075XKF8MD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075XKF8MD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":347376,"name":"EDELIN Magnetic Measuring Cups and Spoons Set, Stainless Steel 7 cup and 6 spoon with 1 Leveler (Magnetic 14 set)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613DYjoq-2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Set of 14 with engraved measurement] You may get sick of printed marking being rubbed off easily as 7.66% reviews point out. Therefore, we change it to easy-reading engraved measurement. You will get 1/8 cup, 1/4 cup, 1/3 cup, 1/2 cup, 2/3 cup, 3/4 cup, 1 cup & 1/8tsp, 1/4tsp, 1/2tsp, 3/4tsp, 1tsp, 1tbsp, 1leveler [BPA free colored silicone with superior craftsmanship] You shall fall in love with the colored silicone handles with engraved marking, easy to recognize the one you want. The slight thumb indentations fit your fingers well and offer a better grip even when your hands are wet and slippery. It makes scooping and gripping easy. The rainbow color makes it fun for kids, 9.16% reviews love that. [Easy Store]This magnetic measuring cup and measuring spoon are stackable and easy to store, the bottom of the measuring cup is smooth, and it is also equipped with a storage steel ring, which can be stored flat or hung in a place where you can easily take it; the middle of the measuring spoon The magnetic force will make them all stick together, and they will not be scattered all over the kitchen drawer when storing, saving space. [Anti-rust 18/8 stainless steel for healthy cooking] Do you want to switch from plastic measurement set to stainless steel one as 13.51% reviews like? Instead of using cheap, rust easily and unhealthy 201/202 stainless steel, U-Taste uses 18/8 stainless steel which won't rust, crack, or break in daily use. With premium material and smooth edge safe for both dishwasher and hand washing. [Magnetic feature - stick to fridge] You shall be interested in magnetic feature as 58.48% reviews do. The strong magnets embedded on the handles make it easy to stick them on your refrigerator and keep them together in your utensil drawer, perfect for limited storage space. No trouble in picking one up for use and then putting back stacked for storage.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613DYjoq-2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EDELIN","source_asin":"B0BD6HV2GD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-347376","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BD6HV2GD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BD6HV2GD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
