window.products.push({"id":347417,"name":"DOZ by SIJO 100% Organic Bamboo Duvet Cover Set, 1 Duvet Cover and 2 Pillowcases, Buttery Soft, Cooling for Hot Sleepers, Eco Friendly, Silky Breathab","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":85.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iMC685HFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DOZ BY SIJO DUVET COVER SETS: SIJO is a bedding brand expertly crafted from innovative materials. Our mission and products have gained us numerous awards and industry recognition. Now, we’re bringing that same expertise and passion for sleep products to our exclusive line, DOZ by SIJO. Rest well knowing that DOZ, backed by the SIJO brand, will feature high quality, well-crafted, and well priced items to help you achieve better sleep night after night. ORGANIC BAMBOO & HIGH GSM: Doz by SIJO bamboo duvet cover set sheets are made of 100% viscose derived from Organic Bamboo from a sustainably-run bamboo farm, and have a lightweight feel with breathable properties. The 145 grams per square meter (GSM) are higher than most bamboo sheets on the market and make Doz sheets one of the most durable sheets on the market while still offering the ultimate softness and lightweight. BUTTERY SOFT: Doz Bamboo viscose material have a sateen weave that gives the duvet cover and pillowcases an exceptionally soft and comfortable feel, and the bedding will drape closely to your skin. People with sensitive skin will appreciate the softness of the sheets, since the fabric produces less friction against the skin during sleep. A 300 thread count makes the sheets smoother and softer than cotton sheets with 1000 thread count. COOLING: Doz bamboo sheets and duvet covers are the best for anyone who sleeps hot, sweats in their sleep, or resides in a relatively warm or humid location. The fabric is highly breathable and also has moisture-wicking properties to keep you dry and comfortable all night long. 8 LOOPS: Our duvet cover set has 8 corner and side loops instead of the traditional 4 loops. Seal off your comforter easily with our beautiful zipper. Wash in a cold, gentle cycle, then tumble dry on low heat. Remove your bedding as soon as the drying cycle is finished to reduce wrinkling, and avoid using fabric softener or dryer balls to prevent premature pilling. Full/Queen 90\"x90\". King/Cal King 106\"x90\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iMC685HFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DOZ by SIJO","source_asin":"B0BZCHNMZC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-347417","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZCHNMZC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZCHNMZC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":347418,"name":"Personalized Campfire Ornament - Smores Ornaments 2022, Marshmallow Ornament, Girl Scout Ornament, Happy Camper Ornament, Personalized Camping Ornamen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41LjFKBhh3L._AC_.jpg","description":"Christmas traditions make Christmas memorable. We carry high-quality and adorable Personalized Campfire Ornament. Think about what you loved about Christmas as a child and start a few traditions this year with your loved ones! Personalized Smores Ornament is a thoughtful gift idea. If you want to impress that special someone, personalize their gift! The saying ‘it’s the thought that counts’ certainly applies when it comes to gift-giving. Ornaments by Elves is the most trusted, highly-rated Personalized Marshmallow Ornament seller — Our talented artists hand-write each personalization for free to match your exact request, using dry-safe custom paint German pens. Ornaments by Elves will process your order the same day of your purchase. You’ll receive your custom Personalized Happy Camper Ornament delivered straight to your door and ready to hang in just a few days. Many people judge the value of a gift not by how much it’s worth, but how it’s presented by the gifter. That is why every order will come with an environmentally friendly special gift box to gift to that special loved one!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41LjFKBhh3L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ornaments by Elves","source_asin":"B07PW141CG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-347418","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PW141CG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PW141CG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
