window.products.push({"id":347462,"name":"ALife Kitchen Timer, Digital Countdown Timer With Large Electronic Digits, Loud Alarm, Strong Magnetic Backing, Stand Hook.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sX9e7hCVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Being busy has become a lifestyle for many people and making time for leisure is considered a luxury. Homacc Digital Timer is your perfect assistant that helps you to manage your time. With Homacc Digital Timer you don’t need “to keep an eye on the time”. You can completely rely on it in your multi-tasking lifestyle. This is the best kitchen timer for your needs. Most modern kitchen timers have an indistinct alarm sound, small screen with unreadable digits, also can’t be moved to the another room. Homacc Digital Timer provides advantages over other timers by significantly improving existing features and implementing new ones such as: - large display with bold digits that can be seen even across the room; - loud alarm sound that you can hear from another room; - user-friendly design with three big buttons to make setup process much easier. There are three choices to place the timer – to attach it to the fridge with its magnetic base, put it on any flat surface with the retractable stand or use its built-in hook. This alarm timer will be your indispensable assistant for all of your cooking needs. You can use it for meditation or homework; as a stopwatch for exercise, sports or games. It’s perfect as an office or classroom timer, for work, learning and time outs (for kids). WARNING: For set up timer put in single AAA battery (not included) and shift down black on/off power switcher and you can use timer for your needs. Features: made of food safe ABS-plastic, remembers last setting, requires only a single AAA battery. (Battery is not included) You'll get the eBook attached on our email as a PDF. You can download, print and read them while using your new timer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sX9e7hCVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Alife","source_asin":"B01521QPOQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-347462","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01521QPOQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01521QPOQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
