window.products.push({"id":347482,"name":"Sweet Water Decor, Beautiful Bride, Sea Salt, Jasmine, Cream, and Wood Scented Soy Wax Candle for Home | 9oz Clear Jar, 40 Hour Burn Time, Made in the","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JY86lv4eL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"THE AROMA OF LOVE. Our beautiful scented bride candle features the calming fragrance of a signature Spa Day. The relaxing notes of sea salt, Jasmine, wood and cream are perfect for wafting in the background for anyone’s big day! MAKES A THOUGHTFUL GIFT. This scented romantic candle makes a beautiful gift for any engaged or newlywed couple - including yourself! You can also use it as a stylish decoration for weddings, bridal showers and bachelor/bachelorette parties. ALL LOVE, NO TOXINS. Our candles feature a proprietary soy-based wax that is gluten-free, lead-free, non-GMO, vegan and Kosher. The premium fragrance oils infused into the wax are also phthalate-free and non-toxic. We use 100% cotton wicks that burn for 40+ hours! CANDLE INFO. Net Weight: 9oz. (7.2oz. Soy-Based Wax + Premium Fragrance Oils) | Clear Candle Jar with Gold Lid | Dimensions: 2.5” L x 2.5” W x 3.5” H | 40+ Hour Burn Time CANDLE CARE. Before each use, trim the wick down to ¼” to avoid soot. To prevent wax tunneling, burn the scented candle until the wax pool reaches the jar edge, making sure not to burn with less than ½” of wax remaining. Never leave your soy-based candle unattended and burn for no more than 4 hours at a time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JY86lv4eL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sweet Water Decor","source_asin":"B09WT8PDVQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-347482","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WT8PDVQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WT8PDVQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
