window.products.push({"id":347526,"name":"Laptop Lunches Bento-ware Bento Lunch Box with BPA-Free, Leak-proof Containers, Berry Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6102BhhNhVL._AC_SL1068_.jpg","description":"It’s easy, fun, and economical to pack balanced on-the-go meals for school, work, and travel with the Laptop Lunches Bento-ware™ line of Bento Lunch Boxes. Available in 11 cool color combinations. This unique bento-style on-the-go meal container features 5 food compartments (including 3 leak-proof containers), perfect for any menu any time. Pack soup and salad, a sandwich, fruit and yogurt, or a snack pack with fresh grapes, veggies and dip, mixed nuts, and pretzels. With this long-lasting waste-free lunch box, you’ll eat well, reduce food waste, and eliminate the need for plastic baggies, foil and expensive single-serve items. Even the pickiest of eaters will enjoy a meal in this easy lunch box! The sleek, single-unit outer lunch box will eliminate your mess of jumbled, mis-matched containers and the removable inner food containers will accommodate just about anything you pack for your active lifestyle. Laptop Lunches Bento-ware is ideal for promoting balance and achieving portion control. Lunch Box includes: 1 – Outer Container – 9”x7”x2 1/4” with inner containers as follows:   1 – Large Sealable Container – 4.75”x3.12”x2” Holds 1 1/4 Cups   1 – Large Container 4.75”x3.12”x2” Holds 1 2/3 Cups   1 – Medium Sealable Container – 3.12”x2.5”x2” Holds 2/3 Cups   1 – Medium Container 3.12”x2.5”x2” Holds 3/4 Cups   1 – Small Sealable Dip Container – 2”x1.5”x1.5” Holds 1/8 Cup.   The Laptop Lunches Bento-ware™ Bento Lunch Box fits perfectly inside the Laptop Lunches Bento-ware™ line of Insulated Bento Carriers, Bento Totes, and Bento Sleeves. The durable plastic containers (not lids) are microwave safe and both containers and lids are dishwasher safe--top rack only (no heat boosters). In addition to allowing for a waste-free meal, the Laptop Lunches Bento-ware™ Bento Lunch Box is manufactured in the USA and, along with all Laptop Lunches Bento-ware™ products, is made of the highest quality non-toxic materials and completely free of phthalates, BPA (bisphenol-A ), lead, and PVC. To accommodate even more lunch items from your favorite menus as well as morning and afternoon snacks, be sure to check out our Bento Buddies reusable containers as well!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6102BhhNhVL._AC_SL1068_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Laptop Lunches Bento-ware","source_asin":"B0088N2YQE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-347526","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0088N2YQE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0088N2YQE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
