window.products.push({"id":347578,"name":"Flash Furniture Cambridge Tufted Upholstered King Size Headboard in Navy Fabric","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":180.4,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21R9-baVqEL._AC_.jpg","description":"If you like reading or using your tablet or laptop in bed, you need a headboard to provide extra support. A headboard gives your room a very personal touch and allows you to show off your style. This gorgeous navy king headboard features button tufting and a diamond stitch pattern design, fabric upholstery, and includes adjustable metal bed rail slots. The slim panel will make your room feel more spacious. Having just a headboard will provide you with floor space and makes it easy to make up the bed. Whether you're updating your master bedroom, guest room or furnishing your first apartment or home, this headboard will give a fresh, on-trend look to your space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21R9-baVqEL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Flash Furniture","source_asin":"B0BJ16Z85Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-347578","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJ16Z85Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJ16Z85Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
