window.products.push({"id":347714,"name":"yeacar Inflatable Lounger Air Sofa, Portable Waterproof Indoor or Outdoor Inflatable Couch for Camping Park Hiking Travelling Picnics Pool Music Festi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ymYUX8HAL._AC_.jpg","description":"yeacar Inflatable Air Lounger: Go Into Your Own Dream World, Relax Your Mind The yeacar inflatable Lounger bed is an awesome hot product that lets you hang out in total comfort, with the yeacar inflatable lounger, you can enjoy the great indoors and outdoors anytime, anywhere;  Whether you go to music festivals, fireworks viewing, pool parties, in the park, hiking, camping, beach parties you have to take it with you! it requires no external pump and is the perfect substitute for folding chairs, bean bags, hammocks, blow up chairs, picnic blankets and pool floats.  Compact portability, ease of use and good looking make yeacar the perfect accessory for indoors or outdoors, on land or water activities, yeacar inflatable lounger opens up another world for you. Warm Tips : Windy day is prefer. A little hard to inflate without wind.  If at home, quick Inflation with a fan, air-blower. Just turn on a fan or air-blower, let the wind injecting into the air lounger, cinch quickly after inflating. Please be patient at the beginning. Experienced user inflate it easily, but new users are suggested to watch the instruction video online before use and try several times when using inflatable lounger. Set-Up Instructions : 1. Take it out of its bag. 2. Unclip and roll it out.  3. Open the mouth of one side of the inflatable lounger. Swoop the Air couch into the air while taking a side step against the Air, allowing you to take a lot of air into the bag. Quickly close the mouth of the bag to trap the air. Repeat with another chamber until both sides are filled with air.  4. Once the air pockets are about 70% inflated. Start Rolling the closed ends forward over 5-6 times until air is compressed and snug tight.  5. Grab the corner ends of the mouth and bend backward until clips come together, buckle clips.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ymYUX8HAL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"yeacar","source_asin":"B0777N1M9Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-347714","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0777N1M9Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0777N1M9Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
