window.products.push({"id":347995,"name":"Balloon Garland Kit 113 Pieces DIY Balloon Arch Garland Kit Decorations for Bachelorette Wedding Baby Showe Birthday Graduation Anniversary Party Back","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FtrSf4gBL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Everyone loves party! We are so glad to recommend you a gorgeous product which helps you set up an awesome party!Perfect for:Baby shower backdrop, birthday party, weddings photo booth props, bachelorette party, bridal shower, kids bedroom, engagement party, gender reveal party,festivals celebration, photo booth backdrop and more.How to make balloon garland？Step 1: Blow up some balloons with balloon pump then tie knots, recommend various colors and blow up different sizes to get a amazing look to your garland.Step 2: Measure and cut balloon strip to desired length, leave extra on each end for hang the decoration later.Step 3: Pull the balloon knot through the strip hole, skip a hole if balloons are too tight.Step 4: Make more gorgeous looking, add some eucalyptus, curling ribbon, flowers, leaves, tulle and more.Package includes: Everyone loves party! We are so glad to recommend you a gorgeous product which helps you set up an awesome party! Perfect for:Baby shower backdrop, birthday party, weddings photo booth props, bachelorette party, bridal shower, kids bedroom, engagement party, gender reveal party,festivals celebration, photo booth backdrop and more.How to make balloon garland？Step 1: Blow up some balloons with balloon pump then tie knots, recommend various colors and blow up different sizes to get a amazing look to your garland.Step 2: Measure and cut balloon strip to desired length, leave extra on each end for hang the decoration later.Step 3: Pull the balloon knot through the strip hole, skip a hole if balloons are too tight.Step 4: Make more gorgeous looking, add some eucalyptus, curling ribbon, flowers, leaves, tulle and more. Package includes: Turquoise Purple PInk White total 70pcs 10Inch and 30pcs 12Inch balloons Turquoise Purple PInk White total 70pcs 10Inch and 30pcs 12Inch balloons 10pcs 12\" Confetti Balloons 10pcs 12\" Confetti Balloons 1 roll balloon garland strip (16 feet) 1 roll balloon garland strip (16 feet) 1 roll balloon glue dot (100pcs glue dots) 1 roll balloon glue dot (100pcs glue dots) 1pcs balloon tying tool 1pcs balloon tying tool","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FtrSf4gBL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Blukey","source_asin":"B07WZVGMCG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-347995","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WZVGMCG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WZVGMCG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":347996,"name":"EUUPS Professional Garlic Press Stainless Steel Heavy Duty Garlic Mincer Kitchen Garlic Crusher Squeezer with Easy Squeeze Ergonomic Handle, Small Kit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51HuzhFUdAL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Save Time In Kitchen - Thanks to the heavy duty construction and ergonomic design, you can easily mince unpeeled garlic with this garlic press stainless steel professional. Garlic presser will make squeezing easier than ever. A normal woman's hand strength can effortlessly make beautifully minced garlic pulp with it. Professional Grade - The professional garlic press consists of a hopper or perforated basket that holds garlic cloves, a plunger that presses garlic through the perforations, and a lever handles that force the plunger down on the cloves. Our premium garlic press is a garlic mincer tool giving you minced garlic in seconds—no knife skills required. Multi-function Garlic Mincer Tool - With ergonomic handle, our garlic crusher garlic cutter enables you mince the garlic effortlessly in seconds. Easily crush garlic, ginger and nuts, and make carrot puree. You can make complementary food for your child. The best part is that your hands won't smell like garlic any more. Having a premium garlic press in a kitchen drawer is a staple for every home. Quality Garlic Press Stainless Steel - The garlic mincer is made of premium stainless steel. Sturdy zinc alloy, stainless steel construction, light and strong, durable and built to last. Our stainless steel garlic mincer has a non-slip handle with silicone rubber coating which is not easy to fall off when used. Easy Use, Easy Cleaning - Peel the garlic and put one or two cloves in the press. Just press the lever and fresh grated garlic is ready for use in the curries, pasta and pizza. Clean up could not be any easier. Just simply rinse your garlic press under running water or place in dishwasher for thorough cleaning. We recommend rinsing right after use to avoid residual garlic pulp and fibers becoming hardened.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51HuzhFUdAL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EUUPS","source_asin":"B08D69GQJ8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-347996","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08D69GQJ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08D69GQJ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
